{"version":1,"content":"<p>中國信科集團光通信技術和網絡全國重點實驗室聯合鵬城實驗室、烽火藤倉光纖科技有限公司，完成24芯多芯光纖實時雙向傳輸試驗，傳輸總容量達到每秒3.2拍比特（Pb/s），刷新單纖雙向實時光傳輸紀錄。團隊今年3月創下的前一項紀錄為2.5 Pb/s，此次提升約28%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584164.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:02:08.204481+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:43:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_hash":"91124307907d206ce3133396bbf253ef16527fc0ff0389ce12cb67f2970c7705","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}